# Editor/one-off backups. These were shipping in the deb payload and the
# release tarball until 6.0.0 -- including a five-month-old viewer.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak[0-9]

# The fork's artwork lives in the fork's own repo, deliberately -- one shared
# art directory across two products is how a fork ends up branded as the thing
# it forked from (see art/README.md).
art/hls-lightcv-server.png

# The AI staging area. Scratch, handoffs, and reference captures -- never
# part of a release, and it holds camera frames that must not reach a public
# repo. Untracked-but-not-ignored is how a `git add -A` sweeps a directory in
# by accident; two such sweeps happened before this line existed.
aibridge/
